<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Electric - 6mth group results.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Electric - 6mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		584.09		vs	  538.94</p>
<p> Operating	   27.71		vs	   21.04</p>
<p> Current	     26.31		vs	   20.11</p>
<p> Net		   10.70		vs	   11.37</p>
<p> EPS		   15.06 yen	  vs	   15.99 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sumitomo Electric Industries Ltd is a major electric wire and cable maker.</p>
</text>
